sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as lowpriv
  participant CA as ADESC-Root-CA
  participant DC as KDC
  Note over CA: Template ESC13 carries an issuance policy OID<br/>OID linked to group ESC13-Privileged (msDS-OIDToGroupLink)
